  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "William Kimmitt said U.S. global AI leadership depends on exporting AI to allies and that Commerce is implementing the American AI Exports Program to promote the American AI technology stack. He said the program aims to expand exports of the American AI technology stack, support U.S. jobs, and help ensure global AI infrastructure is built on American technology, standards, and values. Kimmitt said effective AI adoption can improve productivity and public services, while countries that fall behind risk missing future growth. He said realizing this would require infrastructure, energy, data centers, trusted vendors, training, and legal and regulatory frameworks that encourage innovation while protecting security.",
   "sids": [
    "s6",
    "s7",
    "s9",
    "s11",
    "s2",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "William Kimmitt said U.S. global AI leadership depends on exporting AI to allies and that Commerce is implementing the American AI Exports Program to promote the American AI technology stack.",
