   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s8",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.trade.gov/feature-article/remarks-under-secretary-william-kimmitt-hudson-institute",
   "text": "We want countries choosing American chips, American infrastructure, American software, American standards, and American expertise. That will combine the two great sources of American economic power: the industrial capacity to build and the innovative ability to lead.",
